  <static seed="738" source="Library/Rochester/setVecFunction3Motion/ur_vc_4_9.pg">
    <statement><p>Match the parametric equations with the verbal descriptions of the surfaces by
putting the letter of the verbal description to the left of the letter of the
parametric equation.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>\mathbf{r} \left( u, v \right) = u \cos v \mathbf{i} + u \sin v \mathbf{j} + u^{2} \mathbf{k}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\mathbf{r} \left( u, v \right) = u \mathbf{i} + \cos v \mathbf{j} + \sin v \mathbf{k}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\mathbf{r} \left( u, v \right) = u \mathbf{i} + u \cos v \mathbf{j} + u \sin v \mathbf{k}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\mathbf{r} \left( u, v \right) = u \mathbf{i} + v \mathbf{j} + \left( 2u - 3v \right) \mathbf{k}</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
<p><ol label="A.">
<li>
<p>circular paraboloid</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>circular cylinder</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>cone</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>plane</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
